 split between tossup and lean-Democratic calls.\n\nPolling is sparse and mostly sponsored by partisan outfits; the most recent, from September, showed a one-point race within the margin of error. Pete Buttigieg has campaigned for McCann in Kalamazoo, and energy costs have emerged as a defining issue. The district's Republican lean and Huizenga's incumbency keep this genuinely competitive, but the weight of money and market pricing tilts slightly toward the Democrat.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.5309, "margin": 0.42}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.4667, "margin": -1.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.4711, "margin": -1.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.4732, "margin": -1.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.4842, "margin": 0.3}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.4178, "margin": -0.7}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.4942, "margin": -0.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.4707, "margin": -1.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.417, "margin": -1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.4657, "margin": -1.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.5306, "margin": 0.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.4314, "margin": -1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.5595, "margin": 0.4}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.4501, "margin": -0.3}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.5027, "margin": 0.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.4045, "margin": -1.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.4996, "margin": 0.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.4991, "margin": 0.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.5016, "margin": 0.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.4704, "margin": 0.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.501, "margin": -0.5}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.5344, "margin": 0.5}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.5319, "margin": 0.5}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.4347, "margin": -0.5}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_dem": 0.5003, "margin": 0.5}, {"date": "2026-10-17", "p_dem": 0.5313, "margin": 1.0}, {"date": "2026-10-18", "p_dem": 0.4965, "margi